 "text": "GIS Services / Dearborn County, Indiana\nSkip over navigation\nDearborn County, Indiana\nA unique mixture of agriculture and industrial enterprises with easy access to surrounding areas\nHome\nAbout Us\nSite Tools\nSearch\nToggle Menu\nGovernment toggle Boards & Commissions Board of Health\nBoard of Zoning Appeals\nPark Board\nPlan Commission\nRedevelopment Commission\nRegional Sewer District Board\nSoutheast Regional Community Corrections Advisory Board\nSWCD Board of Supervisors\nCounty Commissioners\nCounty Council\nCounty Officials Assessor's Office\nAuditor's Office\nClerk of Courts\nCoroner's Office\nRecorder's Office\nSurveyor's Office\nTreasurer's Office\nDepartments A - M 911 Communications\nAnimal Control\nAssessor's Office\nAuditor's Office\nBuilding Department\nChild Support Program\nCircuit Court\nClerk of Courts\nCoroner's Office\nCounty Administrator\nCourt Services\nElections\nEmergency Management Agency\nGIS Services\nHealth Department\nHighway Department\nHuman Resources\nMS4\nDepartments N - Z Planning & Zoning\nProsecutor's Office\nRecorder's Office\nRecreation\nRecycling (Solid Waste Management District)\nRegional Sewer District\nSheriff's Office\nSoil & Water Conservation District\nSuperior Court I\nSuperior Court II\nSuveyor's Office\nTreasurer's Office\nVeterans Services\nElection Information\nCourts toggle Circuit Court\nSuperior Court I\nSuperior Court II\nClerk of Courts\nChild Support\nProsecutor\n>> More Court Information\nPublic Safety toggle 911 Communications\nAnimal Control\nEmergency Management\nSheriff's Department\n>> More Public Safety Information\nTaxes toggle Withholding Taxes\nAssessor's Office\nAssessment Appeals Process\nBusiness Personal Property\nProperty Search (GIS)\nTax Sale Information\n>> More Tax Information\nHealth toggle\nHealth Education\nEnvironmental Health\nPublic Health Prepardness\nHealth Officer\n>> More Health Information\nPermits toggle Building Permits\nHealth Permits\nHighway Permits\nZoning Permits\n>> More Permits\nRecreation\nFind It! toggle Ask a Question\nADA & Title VI Compliance\nEmployment Opportunities\nFind a Document\nFind a Permit\nFind a Service\nFrequently Asked Questions\nLearn More About Dearborn County\nSearch Locations & Facilities\nSubmit an Online Form\nTownship Trustees\nView Bids and Proposals\nView County Ordinances\nView the Events Calendar\nView the Image Gallery\nView the Staff Directory\n>> More Information / Links\nStart Content\nGIS Services\nYou are here: Home » Government » GIS Services\nGIS Services\nMission Statement\nDeliver professional services and support to Dearborn County/local government departments through spatial databases, innovative geographic information system (GIS) applications, and strategic partnerships.\nWhat is GIS?\nA geographic information system (GIS) integrates hardware, software, and data for capturing, managing, analyzing, and displaying all forms of geographically referenced information.\nGIS allows us to view, understand, question, interpret, and visualize data in many ways that reveal relationships, patterns, and trends in the form of maps, globes, reports, and charts.\nA GIS helps you answer questions and solve problems by looking at your data in a way that is quickly understood and easily shared.\nGIS technology can be integrated into any enterprise information system framework. (ESRI)\n|\n|\n|\nServices\nServices\nFind Your Elected Officials | | |\nContact Us\n165 Mary St\nLawrenceburg, IN 47025\nGet Directions\nPhone: (812) 532-3242\nFax: (812) 532-3265\nEmail Us\nStaff Directory\nOffice Hours:\nMonday - Friday 8:30am - 4:30pm\nTopics of Interest\nBeacon Tutorials\nJump to a topic or subtopic Make a Selection Beacon Tutorials Topic Home\nMore Information\nAction Center\nLocations\nServices Index\nSite Design and Content Copyright © 2026 Dearborn County, Indiana\nSite Design and Content Management System by CORE Business Technologies\nPrivacy Policy\nAccessibility Statement\nTerms of Use",
